              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyakuchitha yonke imizi ebiyelweyo nayo yonke imizi ekhethiweyo, nigawule yonke imithi emihle, nivale yonke imithombo yamanzi, nichithe ngamatshe zonke iziqephu ezinhle zezwe.",
