              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho bonke abakwaMowabi bezwa ukuthi amakhosi enyukile ukulwa nabo, babuthana bonke ababehloma izikhali nangaphezulu, bema emkhawulweni.",
