              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho inkosi yakwaMowabi ibona ukuthi impi yayinzima kakhulu kuyo, yathatha kanye nayo abantu abangamakhulu ayisikhombisa abahosha inkemba ukuze bafohlele enkosini yakwa-Edomi, kodwa bahluleka.",
