        },
        {
          "text": "Wayesethatha indodana yakhe eyizibulo eyayiyakubusa esikhundleni sayo, wanikela ngayo njengomnikelo wokushiswa odongeni. Kwasekusiba khona intukuthelo enkulu phezu kukaIsrayeli, basebesuka kuye babuyela elizweni labo.",
